    "\n",
    "# 1. sum(self._data[i][k] * other._data[k][j] for k in range(self._cols)): This is the heart of matrix multiplication. For every cell (i, j) in the new matrix, it takes the i-th row of the first matrix and the j-th column of the second matrix, multiplies their corresponding elements, and adds them up.\n",
